#
# A seed or supply line's cost (dibber_rules.h DR4), in Sutra: count units
# (packets, bags, metres of hose) at price minor units of the owner's
# currency each, count * price minor units, exact. count fits 9(6) and
# price 9(9), so a larger or a negative one is a size error: refused,
# where cost.tb answers any count and price from 0: held. Advice only: it
# is no bill.
record supply-line
  count: 9(6)
  price: 9(9)
  cost: 9(15)
procedure
  compute cost = count * price
  answer cost
